  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Special- AACE Food Processing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Food processing Beneficiaries: 500 smallholder farmers, 200 women Description: AACE Foods seeks to transform the snack-food landscape by introducing nutritious readyto-eat snacks made from local contents. Smallholder farmers growing Cowpea and Cassava the two main ingredients in the product will be impacted. They will also be working with retail partners to introduce this product into the mass market.</narrative>
  </description>
